              </span>
            ) : (
              <span>
                DMCH Cabin 114/B • <strong>{chemoDay}</strong> • Blood Group: <strong>B+ (Positive)</strong>
              </span>
            )}
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">
          <a
