                </span>
              ) : (
                <span>
                  17-year-old Md. Araf, an 11th-grade student at Faridpur Polytechnic College, is critically fighting Acute Myeloid Leukemia (AML). His father has been jobless since May, and the family’s savings have completely depleted. Without urgent community support, his life-saving chemotherapy will stop.
