                ? 'হ্যাঁ, অবশ্যই! হাসপাতালে ভর্তির সময় অন্য যেকোনো গ্রুপের রক্ত দান করলেও হাসপাতাল ব্লাড ব্যাংক থেকে আরাফের জন্য প্রয়োজনীয় B+ রক্ত ও প্লাটিলেট সহজেই ক্রস-এক্সচেঞ্জ (বিনিময়) করা যায়। তাই যেকোনো রক্তের গ্রুপের মানুষ আমাদের ডোনার সিস্টেমে যুক্ত হতে পারেন।'
                : 'Yes! Donating any blood group at the hospital allows DMCH blood bank to exchange units for the vital B+ platelets and blood Araf requires. All blood groups are encouraged to register.'}
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-4 open:bg-gray-50/70 transition shadow-2xs">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer list-none">
              <span>{isBn ? 'প্লাটিলেট (SDP) দান কি নিরাপদ এবং এতে কি কোনো শারীরিক ক্ষতি হয়?' : 'Is Single Donor Platelet (SDP) apheresis safe?'}</span>
              <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-4 h-4"></i></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-gray-200 leading-relaxed">
              {isBn
                ? 'প্লাটিলেট দান সম্পূর্ণ নিরাপদ ও বৈজ্ঞানিক প্রক্রিয়া। রক্ত থেকে এফেরেসিস মেশিনের সাহায্যে কেবল প্লাটিলেট আলাদা করে বাকি রক্ত পুনরায় দাতার শরীরে ফেরত পাঠানো হয়। মাত্র ১৫ দিন পর পরই নিরাপদে প্লাটিলেট দেওয়া যায় এবং শরীর কয়েক ঘণ্টার মধ্যে নতুন প্লাটিলেট তৈরি করে ফেলে।'
                : 'Platelet apheresis (SDP) is 100% safe and scientifically proven. Only platelets are separated, while red cells are safely returned to your body. You can safely donate every 15 days.'}
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-4 open:bg-gray-50/70 transition shadow-2xs">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer list-none">
              <span>{isBn ? 'রোগীর সর্বশেষ অবস্থা ও চিকিৎসার অগ্রগতি কীভাবে জানতে পারব?' : 'How can we track Araf’s treatment progress?'}</span>
              <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-4 h-4"></i></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-gray-200 leading-relaxed">
              {isBn
                ? 'এই ওয়েবসাইটে প্রতিদিনের পরিস্থিতি ও রক্তের কাউন্ট নিয়মিত আপডেট করা হয়। এছাড়াও সরাসরি বড় ভাই শেখ মাহমুদ ইসলাম মিজুর নম্বরে (01515616728) যোগাযোগ করতে পারেন।'
                : 'This portal is updated regularly with latest CVC blood parameters and chemotherapy stages. You can also reach coordinator Sheikh Mahmud Islam Mizu directly at 01515616728.'}
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ======================================================== -->
      <!-- SECTION 11: PROMINENT LOGO SHOWCASE BEFORE FOOTER        -->
      <!-- ======================================================== -->
      <section class="py-12 bg-white border-t border-gray-200/80">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-4">
          <div class="inline-block p-4 sm:p-6 bg-gray-50/80 rounded-3xl shadow-2xs border border-gray-200">
            <img
              src={campaignLogoImg}
              alt="Save Araf Official Logo"
              class="h-16 sm:h-24 w-auto mx-auto object-contain"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              width="240"
              height="80"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 max-w-xl mx-auto font-medium leading-relaxed">
            {isBn
              ? 'একটি সম্ভাবনাময় তরুণ প্রাণের জীবন ফিরিয়ে দিতে আমরা সবাই প্রতিজ্ঞাবদ্ধ। আপনার সাহায্য ও দোয়ায় আরাফ আবারও সুস্থ হয়ে স্বাভাবিক জীবনে ফিরবে।'
              : 'Together we stand committed to reviving this vibrant young life. Through your kindness and prayers, Araf will return to his college and family.'}
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <!-- Global Footer -->
    <Footer lang={lang} />

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- LIGHTBOX MODAL FOR MEDICAL REPORTS                       -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <div
      id="lightbox-modal"
      class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/90 z-50 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center p-4"
      role="dialog"
      aria-modal="true"
    >
      <button
        type="button"
        onclick="closeLightbox()"
        class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-white hover:text-amber-400 p-2 text-2xl font-bold cursor-pointer"
        aria-label={isBn ? 'বন্ধ করুন' : 'Close'}
      >
        <i data-lucide="x" class="w-8 h-8"></i>
      </button>
      <div class="max-w-4xl max-h-[85vh] flex flex-col items-center">
        <img id="lightbox-img" src="" alt="Medical Document" class="max-w-full max-h-[80vh] object-contain rounded-lg shadow-2xl" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div id="lightbox-caption" class="text-white text-sm mt-3 font-medium bg-black/60 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- SOCIAL SHARE MODAL                                       -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <div id="share-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/75 z-50 hidden items-center justify-center p-4" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-md w-full p-6 space-y-4 shadow-2xl relative">
        <button
          type="button"
          onclick="closeShareModal()"
          class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600 cursor-pointer"
          aria-label={isBn ? 'বন্ধ করুন' : 'Close'}
        >
          <i data-lucide="x" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
        </button>

        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-rose-50 text-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2">
            <i data-lucide="share-2" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">{isBn ? 'পোস্টটি ছড়িয়ে দিন' : 'Share Campaign'}</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
            {isBn
              ? 'আপনার একটি শেয়ারে হয়তো কোনো হৃদয়বান মানুষের সাহায্যে আরাফের জীবন বেঁচে যেতে পারে।'
              : 'A single share could connect us with someone capable of saving Araf’s life.'}
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2">
          <a
            id="fb-share-btn"
            href="#"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-[#1877f2] hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold py-2 px-3 rounded-xl text-xs transition cursor-pointer"
          >
            <i data-lucide="facebook" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
            <span>{isBn ? 'ফেসবুকে শেয়ার করুন' : 'Share on Facebook'}</span>
          </a>
          <a
            id="wa-share-btn"
            href="#"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-semibold py-2 px-3 rounded-xl text-xs transition cursor-pointer"
          >
            <i data-lucide="message-circle" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
            <span>{isBn ? 'হোয়াটসঅ্যাপে পাঠান' : 'Share via WhatsApp'}</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-gray-100">
          <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 block mb-1">{isBn ? 'ওয়েবসাইটের লিংক কপি করুন:' : 'Copy Website URL:'}</span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <input
              type="text"
              id="share-link-input"
              readonly
              class="w-full text-xs bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-gray-700 select-all font-mono"
            />
            <button
              type="button"
              onclick="copyShareLink()"
              id="share-link-btn"
              class="bg-gray-900 text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-800 transition cursor-pointer"
            >
              {isBn ? 'কপি' : 'Copy'}
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- TOAST NOTIFICATION CONTAINER                             -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <div
      id="toast"
      class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 bg-gray-900 text-white px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-xl text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-2 z-50 transform translate-y-20 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-none"
    >
      <i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400"></i>
      <span id="toast-msg">{isBn ? 'কপি করা হয়েছে!' : 'Copied!'}</span>
    </div>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- CLIENT INTERACTIVE SCRIPTS                               -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <script is:inline>
      (() => {
        // 1. Initialize Lucide Icons
        if (typeof lucide !== 'undefined' && lucide.createIcons) {
          lucide.createIcons();
        }

        // 2. 5-Tab Impact Strategy Switcher
        window.switchImpactTab = (idx) => {
          const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.impact-tab-btn');
          tabs.forEach((tab, i) => {
            if (i === idx) {
              tab.classList.remove('bg-gray-100', 'text-gray-700');
              tab.classList.add('bg-rose-600', 'text-white', 'shadow-2xs');
            } else {
              tab.classList.remove('bg-rose-600', 'text-white', 'shadow-2xs');
              tab.classList.add('bg-gray-100', 'text-gray-700');
            }
          });

          for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
            const panel = document.getElementById(`panel-${i}`);
            if (panel) {
              if (i === idx) {
                panel.classList.remove('hidden');
              } else {
                panel.classList.add('hidden');
              }
            }
          }

          if (typeof lucide !== 'undefined' && lucide.createIcons) {
            lucide.createIcons();
          }
        };

        // 3. Lightbox Functions
        window.openLightbox = (src, caption) => {
          const modal = document.getElementById('lightbox-modal');
          const img = document.getElementById('lightbox-img');
          const cap = document.getElementById('lightbox-caption');
          if (modal && img && cap) {
            img.src = src;
            cap.innerText = caption || '';
            modal.classList.remove('hidden');
            modal.classList.add('flex');
            document.body.classList.add('modal-active');
          }
        };

        window.closeLightbox = () => {
          const modal = document.getElementById('lightbox-modal');
          if (modal) {
            modal.classList.add('hidden');
            modal.classList.remove('flex');
            document.body.classList.remove('modal-active');
          }
        };

        const lightboxModal = document.getElementById('lightbox-modal');
        if (lightboxModal) {
          lightboxModal.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
            if (e.target === lightboxModal) {
              window.closeLightbox();
            }
          });
        }

        // 4. Toast Notification
        window.showToast = (msg) => {
          const toast = document.getElementById('toast');
          const toastMsg = document.getElementById('toast-msg');
          if (toast && toastMsg) {
            toastMsg.innerText = msg;
            toast.classList.remove('opacity-0', 'translate-y-20');
            toast.classList.add('opacity-100', 'translate-y-0');
            setTimeout(() => {
              toast.classList.remove('opacity-100', 'translate-y-0');
              toast.classList.add('opacity-0', 'translate-y-20');
            }, 3000);
          }
        };

        // 5. Copy to Clipboard
        window.copyToClipboard = (text, btnId) => {
          if (!text) return;

          const executeCopy = () => {
            window.showToast(`কপি করা হয়েছে: ${text}`);
            const btn = document.getElementById(btnId);
            if (btn) {
              const originalHTML = btn.innerHTML;
              btn.innerHTML = `<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓ কপি হয়েছে!</span>`;
              setTimeout(() => {
                btn.innerHTML = originalHTML;
                if (typeof lucide !== 'undefined' && lucide.createIcons) {
                  lucide.createIcons();
                }
              }, 2000);
            }
          };

          if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {
            navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(executeCopy).catch(() => {
              fallbackCopy(text);
              executeCopy();
            });
          } else {
            fallbackCopy(text);
            executeCopy();
          }
        };

        function fallbackCopy(text) {
          const textArea = document.createElement('textarea');
          textArea.value = text;
          textArea.style.position = 'fixed';
          textArea.style.opacity = '0';
          document.body.appendChild(textArea);
          textArea.focus();
          textArea.select();
          try {
            document.execCommand('copy');
          } catch (e) {
            console.error('Fallback copy error:', e);
          }
          document.body.removeChild(textArea);
        }

        window.copyAllBankDetails = () => {
          const details = `Bank Name: The City Bank PLC\nAccount Name: SHEIKH MAHMUD ISLAM MIZU\nAccount Number: 2395230791001\nBranch District: DHAKA-SOUTH\nBranch Name: VIP ROAD BRANCH (DHAKA)\nRouting Number: 225276851\nMobile/Emergency: 01515616728`;
          if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {
            navigator.clipboard.writeText(details).then(() => {
              window.showToast('সম্পূর্ণ ব্যাংক তথ্য কপি করা হয়েছে!');
            }).catch(() => {
              fallbackCopy(details);
              window.showToast('সম্পূর্ণ ব্যাংক তথ্য কপি করা হয়েছে!');
            });
          } else {
            fallbackCopy(details);
            window.showToast('সম্পূর্ণ ব্যাংক তথ্য কপি করা হয়েছে!');
          }
        };

        // 6. Share Modal
        window.openShareModal = () => {
          const modal = document.getElementById('share-modal');
          const currentUrl = window.location.href;
          const shareInput = document.getElementById('share-link-input');
          if (shareInput) shareInput.value = currentUrl;

          const shareText = encodeURIComponent(
            'বাঁচতে চায় ক্যানসার আক্রান্ত ১৭ বছরের কলেজছাত্র আরাফ। ঢাকা মেডিকেলের ১১৪/বি কেবিনে কেমো চলছে। দয়া করে পোস্টটি শেয়ার করুন বা যার যতটুকু সামর্থ্য আছে এগিয়ে আসুন।'
          );
          const shareUrl = encodeURIComponent(currentUrl);

          const fbBtn = document.getElementById('fb-share-btn');
          if (fbBtn) fbBtn.href = `https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=${shareUrl}&quote=${shareText}`;

          const waBtn = document.getElementById('wa-share-btn');
          if (waBtn) waBtn.href = `https://api.whatsapp.com/send?text=${shareText}%20${shareUrl}`;

          if (modal) {
            modal.classList.remove('hidden');
            modal.classList.add('flex');
          }
        };

        window.closeShareModal = () => {
          const modal = document.getElementById('share-modal');
          if (modal) {
            modal.classList.add('hidden');
            modal.classList.remove('flex');
          }
        };

        window.copyShareLink = () => {
          const input = document.getElementById('share-link-input');
          if (input) {
            window.copyToClipboard(input.value, 'share-link-btn');
          }
        };

        const shareModal = document.getElementById('share-modal');
        if (shareModal) {
          shareModal.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
            if (e.target === shareModal) {
              window.closeShareModal();
            }
          });
        }

        // 7. Toggle Full 33 Reports Gallery
        const toggleReportsBtn = document.getElementById('toggle-all-reports-btn');
        const allReportsContainer = document.getElementById('all-reports-container');
        const toggleReportsText = document.getElementById('toggle-reports-text');
        const toggleReportsIcon = document.getElementById('toggle-reports-icon');

        if (toggleReportsBtn && allReportsContainer) {
          toggleReportsBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const isHidden = allReportsContainer.classList.contains('hidden');
            if (isHidden) {
              allReportsContainer.classList.remove('hidden');
              if (toggleReportsText) toggleReportsText.innerText = 'সকল রিপোর্ট আড়াল করুন';
              if (toggleReportsIcon) toggleReportsIcon.classList.add('rotate-180');
            } else {
              allReportsContainer.classList.add('hidden');
              if (toggleReportsText) toggleReportsText.innerText = 'সকল ৩৩ পৃষ্ঠার বিস্তারিত রিপোর্ট দেখুন';
              if (toggleReportsIcon) toggleReportsIcon.classList.remove('rotate-180');
            }
            if (typeof lucide !== 'undefined' && lucide.createIcons) {
              lucide.createIcons();
            }
          });
        }

        // 8. ESC Key Listener for All Modals
        window.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
          if (e.key === 'Escape') {
            window.closeLightbox();
            window.closeShareModal();
          }
        });
      })();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
